{"attack":"利用超能力互换自己和对手的特性。","description":"自身和目标交换特性。因替换宝可梦或陷入濒死状态而退场后，恢复自身原本持有的特性。\n以下情况时，招式使用失败：\n\n自身或目标为无法被交换的特性，包括：\n神奇守护、多属性、幻觉、达摩模式、战斗切换、群聚变形、 牵绊变身、画皮、鱼群、界限盾壳、ＡＲ系统、饱了又饿、一口导弹、结冻头、人马一体、绝对睡眠、化学变化气体、全能变身、发号施令、古代活性和夸克充能；\n目标为极巨化的宝可梦。\n部分入场时发动的特性如威吓、日照、破格等，在被交换后会立即发动一次。\n处于无特性状态时可以使出该招式，但交换后不会解除无特性状态。\n该招式无视目标的替身状态。\n目标为对方的宝可梦时会将双方原本的特性显示出来，目标为同伴时则不会显示。\n特性互换一定会命中，除非目标正在使用蓄力的招式并不在场地上。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Deoxys","Level":43},{"Name":"Deoxys form:attack","Level":43},{"Name":"Deoxys form:defense","Level":43},{"Name":"Deoxys form:speed","Level":43},{"Name":"Sigilyph","Level":60},{"Name":"Solosis","Level":40},{"Name":"Duosion","Level":46},{"Name":"Reuniclus","Level":48},{"Name":"Spritzee","Level":39},{"Name":"Aromatisse","Level":39},{"Name":"Sylveon","Level":40},{"Name":"Carbink","Level":40},{"Name":"Diancie","Level":56},{"Name":"Hoopa form:confined","Level":25},{"Name":"Hoopa form:unbound","Level":25},{"Name":"TapuLele","Level":70}],"tutorMoves":["Venonat","Venomoth","Drowzee","Hypno","Misdreavus","Girafarig","Stantler","Spoink","Grumpig","Spinda","Kecleon","Shuppet","Banette","Chimecho","Deoxys","Deoxys form:attack","Deoxys form:defense","Deoxys form:speed","Deoxys form:sus","Wormadam form:plant","Wormadam form:sandy","Wormadam form:trash","Mothim","Mismagius","Chingling","Manaphy","Meloetta form:aria","Braixen","Delphox","Hoopa form:confined","Hoopa form:unbound"],"eggMoves":["Kecleon"],"trMoves":["Butterfree","Abra","Kadabra","Alakazam","Slowpoke","Slowpoke form:galarian","Slowbro","Slowbro form:galarian","Gastly","Haunter","Gengar","Exeggcute","Exeggutor","Exeggutor form:alolan","Chansey","Starmie","MrMime","MrMime form:galarian","Jynx","Articuno form:galarian","Mewtwo","Mew","Natu","Xatu","Espeon","Slowking","Slowking form:galarian","Smoochum","Blissey","Lugia","Celebi","Ralts","Kirlia","Gardevoir","Lunatone form:gibbous","Lunatone form:quarter","Lunatone form:full","Lunatone form:new_moon","Lunatone form:crescent","Solrock","Baltoy","Claydol","Duskull","Du